DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\nCome join us for brunch at Shine in Hen
 dersonville. Space is limited to 12\, so be sure to sign up early. If your
  plans change\, no problem. Just be sure to update your RSVP so we can mov
 e people over from the waitlist or update our reservation.\n\nI hope to se
 e you at Shine!\n\nWe will meet-up at Saint Paul Mountain Vineyards after 
 brunch for those interested!
